(7635858, 1238661, 67258, '<td valign="top">If anyone told me I would be spending my lunch break analysing a photo of a tomato, I''d think they were barking, but this is actually quite interesting.  The low key, low contrast look works well, and is far more interesting than a more traditionally lit image.  Photographing it from behind also makes visual sense, especially in relation to the specific challenge</td>', 'If anyone told me I would be spending my lunch break analysing a photo of a tomato, I''d think they were barking, but this is actually quite interesting.  The low key, low contrast look works well, and is far more interesting than a more traditionally lit image.  Photographing it from behind also makes visual sense, especially in relation to the specific challenge', '2019-07-22 08:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
