(7636452, 1238918, 114285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, lovely depth of field, and sharpness, I really appreciate how difficult these hummingbirds are to shoot.  I tried when I was in America..., man holding that huge lens and trying to focus on this bird which flies at 1,000,000 miles an hour, so hard...so anyway Im bumping this up.  Pretty sure it will be the blue. <br/> <br/> I love your editing also, this looks like a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful image, lovely depth of field, and sharpness, I really appreciate how difficult these hummingbirds are to shoot.  I tried when I was in America..., man holding that huge lens and trying to focus on this bird which flies at 1,000,000 miles an hour, so hard...so anyway Im bumping this up.  Pretty sure it will be the blue.   I love your editing also, this looks like a painting.', '2019-07-28 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
